{"id":"825d6b8eb9724aea","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-motive.md","title":"Motive","display":"df-motive — Motive","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-motive","aliases":["58-df-motive"],"display":"df-motive — Motive","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-motive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-motive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-motive — Motive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,X,p,m,\\mathrm{Corr},\\circledast\\in V\">\\(M,X,p,m,\\mathrm{Corr},\\circledast\\in V\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Corr}\">\\(\\mathrm{Corr}\\)</span> 是显式给定的 correspondence carrier，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circledast\">\\(\\circledast\\)</span> 是其合成</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\circledast,\\mathrm{Corr}\\times\\mathrm{Corr},\\mathrm{Corr})\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\circledast,\\mathrm{Corr}\\times\\mathrm{Corr},\\mathrm{Corr})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChowMotiveCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ChowMotiveCode}_S\\)</span>（本文件定义的相对幂等元代码）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}motive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChowMotiveCode}_S(M,X,p,m;\\mathrm{Corr},\\circledast)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\circledast,\\mathrm{Corr}\\times\\mathrm{Corr},\\mathrm{Corr})\\land\np\\in\\mathrm{Corr}\\land\\circledast(\\langle p,p\\rangle)=p\\land m\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\nM=\\langle X,p,m\\rangle\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}motive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChowMotiveCode}_S(M,X,p,m;\\mathrm{Corr},\\circledast)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\circledast,\\mathrm{Corr}\\times\\mathrm{Corr},\\mathrm{Corr})\\land\np\\in\\mathrm{Corr}\\land\\circledast(\\langle p,p\\rangle)=p\\land m\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\nM=\\langle X,p,m\\rangle\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Grothendieck's standard conjecture: numerical equivalence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\text{num}}\">\\(\\sim_{\\text{num}}\\)</span> equals homological equivalence.</li>\n<li>对真正的 Chow motive，须另外证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 光滑射影、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Corr}=\\mathrm{CH}^{\\dim X}(X\\times_kX)_{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(\\mathrm{Corr}=\\mathrm{CH}^{\\dim X}(X\\times_kX)_{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circledast\">\\(\\circledast\\)</span> 是标准 correspondence composition；本原子只形式化 Karoubi-envelope 中的显式幂等元编码。</li>\n<li>A decomposition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(X)\\cong\\bigoplus_i M^i(X)\">\\(M(X)\\cong\\bigoplus_i M^i(X)\\)</span> requires suitable Chow–Künneth projectors and is not part of the unconditional definition.</li>\n<li>Motives relate cohomology theories: Betti, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span>-adic, crystalline.</li>\n<li>Period conjecture: algebraic relations among periods.</li>\n<li>Standard conjectures imply Hodge conjecture.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(\\circledast,\\mathrm{Corr}\\times\\mathrm{Corr},\\mathrm{Corr})$（see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,X,p,m,\\mathrm{Corr},\\circledast\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Corr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circledast","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\circledast,\\mathrm{Corr}\\times\\mathrm{Corr},\\mathrm{Corr})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChowMotiveCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}motive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ChowMotiveCode}_S(M,X,p,m;\\mathrm{Corr},\\circledast)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\circledast,\\mathrm{Corr}\\times\\mathrm{Corr},\\mathrm{Corr})\\land\np\\in\\mathrm{Corr}\\land\\circledast(\\langle p,p\\rangle)=p\\land m\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\nM=\\langle X,p,m\\rangle\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sim_{\\text{num}}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Corr}=\\mathrm{CH}^{\\dim X}(X\\times_kX)_{\\mathbb Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circledast","display":false},{"tex":"M(X)\\cong\\bigoplus_i M^i(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-865","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-motive.md|58-df-motive]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}